<article class="prose wrap">
  {% include "partials/breadcrumbs.njk" %}
  <p class="eyebrow">Self-storage operators</p>
  <h1>List your business</h1>
  <p>If you operate a self-storage facility and you publish access hours, office hours, climate-control options, or month-to-month terms on your website, we want the record to be accurate.</p>
  <p>Send:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Facility name and the city or neighborhood</li>
    <li>Street address, phone, and website</li>
    <li>Access (gate) hours and office hours for each day, including Saturday and Sunday if you publish them</li>
    <li>Whether you offer climate-controlled units, month-to-month leases, 24-hour or extended access, or package acceptance</li>
    <li>A public page where we can verify those facts</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We will not publish hours or amenities we cannot check on a public source, and we may recrawl your page before each update. We will not list live vacancy or current unit prices as if they were guaranteed.</p>
  <p>
    <a class="button" href="mailto:{{ site.emailListings }}?subject=List%20a%20storage%20facility">Email {{ site.emailListings }}</a>
  </p>
</article>
